Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.84,0:00:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.08,0:00:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The paint within brings\Nout a map of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left and the right,\Nall we saw stormy nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.82,0:00:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All the rough winds and\Nwaves coming day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.10,0:00:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And the values we had\Nwere about to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.36,0:00:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down to the compass in\Nhand Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.74,0:00:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody\Nhere knows it for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So close your eyes and breathe in deeply.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.04,0:00:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And listen to your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.24,0:00:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see a path in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'll know just where you need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.62,0:00:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.90,0:00:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make us stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.12,0:01:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the darkness\Nwin. Just break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.62,0:01:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it my own way,\Nthat's what's best for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.22,0:01:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And you do it your way,\Nthat's how it's got to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.88,0:01:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We're moving forward. Now I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.44,0:01:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But at times it's okay\Nto get help on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.30,0:01:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,For the future ahead, burning bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.84,0:01:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,For what's ahead you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.26,0:01:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is beyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.60,0:01:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.84,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.08,0:01:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the darkness\Nwin. Just break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.44,0:01:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it our way,\Nthe best that we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.18,0:01:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,With tears and doubts and tone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.66,0:01:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll go where we all wanna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.98,0:01:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The page within brings colors of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.56,0:02:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard him, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.80,0:02:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep up the fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.04,0:02:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You really believe Straw\NHat will defeat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.30,0:02:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You really believe that\NWano's borders will open?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.96,0:02:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a fairy tale ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.42,0:03:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a damn child!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.72,0:03:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm losing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.90,0:03:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I will defeat Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.20,0:03:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Our samurai are strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.30,0:03:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not waiting for Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.06,0:03:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We're facing you head on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.22,0:03:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We're...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.13,0:03:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.00,0:03:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.44,0:03:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll die beside you if I must.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.48,0:03:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Fripe Fripe Jutsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.96,0:03:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Grr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.04,0:04:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Robot, Robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.98,0:04:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke is out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.94,0:04:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.20,0:04:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The samurai don't have a leader\Nanymore if that Brad's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.04,0:04:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta broadcast his\Ndeath to the whole island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.62,0:04:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll surrender, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.52,0:04:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.22,0:04:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.38,0:04:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's crush their spirits!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.34,0:04:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,She's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.98,0:04:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The crow is coming back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.22,0:04:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make our way to the performance\Nfloor just like we planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.18,0:04:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sound good? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.62,0:04:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If Loopy is doing his best,\Nthen we will as well. Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.64,0:04:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy for Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.38,0:04:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.04,0:04:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is my Climatac talking to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.90,0:04:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Nami. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.32,0:04:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It has a face too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.42,0:04:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is weird! Jeepers!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.28,0:04:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.34,0:04:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma-ma-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.78,0:04:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think Straw\NHat could defeat Kaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.62,0:04:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid, or is this some joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.22,0:05:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just hoping I'd have the\Npleasure of killing him myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.72,0:05:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.88,0:05:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as he's dead, at least\Nhe won't be a thorn in my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.92,0:05:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking as someone who's\Nworked with him for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.54,0:05:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling he'll survive, even\Nif it doesn't make any damn sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.96,0:05:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Who asked you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.94,0:05:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.56,0:05:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Big mom's the enemy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.42,0:05:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Our enemy, so grow up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.40,0:05:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This once we can form an alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.64,0:05:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm such a genius that my\Ngenius even surpassed myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.72,0:05:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, I made that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.14,0:05:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So if it can talk, it must be my\Ndoing. What? No! Look, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.26,0:05:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all buzzers!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.90,0:05:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Last I saw, that other cloud ate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.82,0:05:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How the heck did you end up like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.24,0:06:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That was weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.44,0:06:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,After Mama grabbed me, my\Nspirit started leaving my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.04,0:06:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish him off, Hera!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.48,0:06:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I was lost in a daze. Powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.36,0:06:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And that Lady Hera was gonna couple me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.80,0:06:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a snack out of pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.30,0:06:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat them and run, okay, girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.02,0:06:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.52,0:06:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you stretched out your\Nweapon and offered me a snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.20,0:06:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat them! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.38,0:06:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.10,0:06:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.84,0:06:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dinner time for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.54,0:06:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, I guess when Hera bit me, it\Nsmushed my body into your rod thingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.42,0:06:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And just like magic...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.34,0:06:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I came back to life, good as new.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.68,0:06:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's fine for you, but\Nit's a pain in the butt for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.92,0:06:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.90,0:06:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though you saved me,\Nyou haven't forgiven me yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.96,0:07:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have so much power anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.46,0:07:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If you could just find\Nit in your heart, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.38,0:07:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.78,0:07:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.70,0:07:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks like the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.30,0:07:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama, let's go there and give a command.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.64,0:07:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.76,0:07:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You listening, Onigashima?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.44,0:07:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got news!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.36,0:07:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy's leader, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.62,0:07:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to interrupt, ma'am,\Nbut the Sawhats are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.96,0:07:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a Huang lat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.68,0:07:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Huang motor!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.68,0:07:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.60,0:07:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.28,0:07:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This brat is the real problem! Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.70,0:07:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of her, our gifters started\Nbetraying each other one after the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.24,0:07:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She even got Big Mom on her side. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.34,0:07:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,She took that attack from Big\NMom and got right back up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.38,0:07:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa got beat up because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.18,0:07:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I told you to leave her alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.38,0:08:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.78,0:08:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen it do that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.78,0:08:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy, just use your\Nbaton like you always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.68,0:08:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll add attacks of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.66,0:08:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Your skin's too tough\Nfor us to break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.92,0:08:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, we'll damage our\Ninsides like Mama's attack did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.56,0:08:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,One good lightning blast\Nshould do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.12,0:08:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that'll cause too much destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.50,0:08:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to keep Otama sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.86,0:08:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What, Capone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.70,0:08:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You got this, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.28,0:08:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They're so dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.50,0:08:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Special attack, green star!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.08,0:08:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Koza!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.16,0:08:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I separated them! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.84,0:08:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.22,0:08:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Luffy's defeat\Nwould shut the samurai down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.70,0:09:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,but not a single one of them surrendered.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.32,0:09:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to brief you on the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.80,0:09:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A total of 5,000 troops on both sides\Nhave been rendered unfit for combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.54,0:09:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,When the battle began,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.12,0:09:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,the Beast Pirates had 24,000\Nfighters, and the Rebels had 3,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.38,0:09:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.29,0:09:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,all of the pleasures and\Nwaiters on the performance
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.54,0:09:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,floor seem to have turned\Nagainst Master Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.70,0:09:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So the enemy gained 4,000 recruits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.20,0:09:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,At present, the Beast Pirates\Nhave roughly 20,000 troops,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.60,0:09:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and the Rebels have roughly 7,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.34,0:09:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to see the gap\Nbegin to close so late in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.20,0:09:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The situation is completely volatile.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.52,0:09:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,On that note, we just received a report\Nthat might cause another shift in balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.18,0:09:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Gifters!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.62,0:09:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They came here to kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.08,0:09:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.70,0:10:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Pack it up, you traitors!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.52,0:10:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The gifters are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.36,0:10:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So the pleasures and waiters on this\Nfloor revolted against Master Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.30,0:10:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What, do they have a death wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.20,0:10:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, not very smart, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.12,0:10:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't they get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.56,0:10:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Those peons are supposed to be\Nsacrificed at times like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.48,0:10:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Trash has no right to complain\Nabout being taken out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.76,0:10:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wipe out every traitor on the floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.86,0:10:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Show no mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.08,0:10:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.80,0:10:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Gorilla Punch Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.54,0:10:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Suck on that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.80,0:10:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Rutheran Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.58,0:10:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Thundercloud, you're up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.66,0:10:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.20,0:10:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Zeus, you're out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.58,0:10:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.49,0:10:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I'd call\Nme Zeus anymore. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.20,0:10:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a cool new me after all, So why\Ndon't you give me a cool new name?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.30,0:10:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.20,0:11:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.38,0:11:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.54,0:11:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.28,0:11:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay! Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.80,0:11:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Fluff!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.72,0:11:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stick with Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.86,0:11:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to get to Nami,\Nyou gotta go through me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.80,0:11:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it your best shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.12,0:11:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sick of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.68,0:11:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Same.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.92,0:11:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been playing tag for long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.40,0:11:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm putting an end to this right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.60,0:11:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.84,0:11:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.84,0:11:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.94,0:11:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.64,0:11:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.18,0:11:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my job to hit my target!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.40,0:12:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's what I'm gonna do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.72,0:12:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.22,0:12:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That means I need help. You!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.56,0:12:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And what Paige might already do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.44,0:12:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They've managed to take out\Ntwo of them as a dummy so slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.70,0:12:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.42,0:12:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.68,0:12:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are these guys a lot\Nstronger than we thought?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.08,0:12:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not actually losing, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.86,0:12:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.20,0:12:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Mace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.36,0:12:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone on Onigashima\Ncan hear you freaking out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.48,0:12:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.66,0:12:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot I was still broadcasting!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.46,0:12:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.37,0:13:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, did I say they beat Lady Oji?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.54,0:13:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I meant Baby Robin Oji!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.66,0:13:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So she works as a transmitter, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.76,0:13:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then. Oof!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.50,0:13:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Special Attack Green Star Devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.76,0:13:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.42,0:13:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.62,0:13:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how her power works,\Nbut that girl is like a transmitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.28,0:13:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If you make a command, the\Nwhole island will hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.70,0:13:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.84,0:14:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Otama!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.04,0:14:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.86,0:14:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Otama is here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.20,0:14:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.38,0:14:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not safe for her here. It's her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.08,0:14:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get her, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.74,0:14:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,One more round!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.10,0:14:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,One more kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.58,0:14:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful, isn't it, Otokon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.10,0:15:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The fire festival is our time\Nto honor those we've lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.02,0:15:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We build a fire to reach\Nthem in heaven itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.92,0:15:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Daddy can see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.32,0:15:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course he can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.80,0:15:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't a cloud in the sky, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.98,0:15:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's watching\Nover you and watching
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.02,0:15:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,over the fate of this\Ncountry he loved so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.94,0:15:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard a voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.12,0:15:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's there? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.66,0:15:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right I see something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.40,0:15:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.44,0:15:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.46,0:15:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell did you hear him underwater?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.88,0:15:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares? Just bring him in!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.06,0:16:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.97,0:16:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He might be alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.42,0:16:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose baby is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.40,0:16:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here, you little shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.54,0:16:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a battlefield!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.32,0:16:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And what the hell did you do to Bao Huang?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.70,0:16:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.68,0:16:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Utama!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.59,0:16:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.54,0:16:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.20,0:16:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.98,0:16:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you gonna complain\Nabout being outnumbered?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.40,0:16:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems pretty unfair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.92,0:16:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It was 5,000 versus\N30,000 when we came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.04,0:16:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what everyone expected\Nfrom the very beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.20,0:16:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A one-on-one battle was\Nnever in the cards for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.42,0:16:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How annoyingly pragmatic of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.80,0:16:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.26,0:16:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Our job is to keep the top\Nofficers busy till Luffy wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.88,0:16:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So grumble as long as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.00,0:17:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one after another with these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.46,0:17:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A knock him down and more show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.76,0:17:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Strength and determination mean nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.52,0:17:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what matters in this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.92,0:17:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Because this isn't a battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.08,0:17:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an Alto war.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.80,0:17:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your own fault for forgetting that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.04,0:17:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is she still doing up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.30,0:17:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Just looking at her pisses me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.64,0:17:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, someone take care of that brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.00,0:17:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, on it, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.62,0:17:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.42,0:17:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Otama, hurry! Do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.82,0:17:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, all my friends, you hate giving Tang!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.68,0:17:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to ask you a favor!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.44,0:17:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you switch sides, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.70,0:17:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Big bro, Lumi, and Mama Natsuka need you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.88,0:17:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to have some fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.42,0:18:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's all work together!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.72,0:18:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And turn down Carter!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.38,0:18:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.08,0:18:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You think they'll listen to you just\Nbecause you ass nice, you dumb brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.02,0:18:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for\Nputting it on my show!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.18,0:18:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.84,0:18:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Your wish is my command!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.48,0:18:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Take down Tidal!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.30,0:18:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's start with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.04,0:18:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.82,0:18:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.32,0:18:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, General Briscola? Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.74,0:18:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here to take out some traitors,\Nso let's stomp them already!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.10,0:18:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.20,0:18:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you loud and clear, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.90,0:18:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start out with\Na Gorilla Punch Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.42,0:18:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just for you, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.64,0:19:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.55,0:19:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like Master's given the order.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.58,0:19:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Gazelle Man! Difugo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.82,0:19:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to join the fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.54,0:19:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You see that, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.22,0:19:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm working hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.68,0:19:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are all the dipters trying to kill us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.76,0:19:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.68,0:19:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Just run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.98,0:19:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're coming for you, Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.06,0:19:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.26,0:19:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.64,0:19:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Gifters, lend me your strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.76,0:19:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fight for our wonderful\Nmaster with all we've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.68,0:19:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.88,0:19:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.98,0:19:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.06,0:20:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's all bloated!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.20,0:20:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you he was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.50,0:20:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And I told you to shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.16,0:20:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not helping at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.58,0:20:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.49,0:20:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain can help if you were here, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.86,0:20:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.88,0:20:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to clear his lungs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.46,0:20:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.22,0:20:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Booviceye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.02,0:20:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if he wasn't dead, you\Nmight have just killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.84,0:20:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He's rubber. He'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.10,0:20:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I hope he will at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.06,0:20:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.74,0:20:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.98,0:20:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it, that rubber's burnt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.62,0:20:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.50,0:21:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He missed you! He missed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.38,0:21:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But like kites, we rise\Nhighest against the wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.92,0:21:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Minpo, great kite!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.88,0:21:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.06,0:21:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now if I can just find a place to land...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.24,0:21:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That was awful...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.54,0:21:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We escaped from that\Nhorrible place, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.66,0:21:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What caused...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.74,0:21:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to the others? Do you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.20,0:21:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think they could still be alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.66,0:21:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiku...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.57,0:21:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Kine-man!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.18,0:21:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.86,0:22:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Conney!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.34,0:22:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you mean father,\Ndon't you, Yamato?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.32,0:22:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to finally cut ties with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.94,0:22:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.30,0:22:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about that, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.00,0:22:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.80,0:22:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You have nothing without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.88,0:22:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat is sunk into the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.24,0:22:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Odin's son suffered the same fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.72,0:22:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have the will to fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.82,0:22:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,you should have protected\Nthem while you had the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.74,0:22:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.94,0:23:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need to protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.46,0:23:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They're both much stronger than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.50,0:23:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I fight beside them as equals\Nand what happens after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.38,0:23:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you're gonna break\Nfree of this country of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.52,0:23:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy will show me the world you've\Nkept from me, but before I leave here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.80,0:23:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm kicking you out of\Nthis country understand
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.56,0:23:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.26,0:23:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The land of water is extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.26,0:23:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no place like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.40,0:23:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't defeat me, and I'll never leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.38,0:23:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So stay with me, and become\Nthe Shogun of this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.20,0:23:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you no!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.18,0:24:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know I won't be\Nthe one to defeat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.94,0:24:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.50,0:24:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he's the man Kozuki\NOden was waiting for!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.10,0:24:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll return, stronger than ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.00,0:24:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is\Nkeep you busy till then!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.36,0:24:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't expect me to go easy on you, Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.50,0:24:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No mercy!
